original Nexus code covering all 15 modes). ISC and MIT are both permissive and
GPL-compatible, so the vendored receiver redistributes cleanly inside the GPLv3
whole. slowrx is an independent project, unmaintained upstream; Nexus is not
affiliated with or endorsed by it.

