## DeepCW model (the AI CW decoder)
Nexus's PRIMARY CW decoder is powered by the DeepCW neural-network model,
created by **e04** (https://github.com/e04/deepcw-engine), licensed
**AGPL-3.0-only** — our thanks for an outstanding piece of weak-signal
engineering. The model ships as an app resource (resources/deepcw/); its
source form (the ONNX weights + metadata) is available from the upstream
repository, and Nexus's modification (constant-folding the graph at the fixed
15 s decode window) is documented in src-tauri/resources/deepcw/README.md.
Per GPLv3 §13/AGPLv3 §13 the combination is conveyed under both licenses'
terms; the classic decoder remains as the automatic fallback if the model is
absent. The inference and stitching code around the model is original Nexus
code (GPL-3.0). The **full AGPL-3.0 license text ships with the model** at
`resources/deepcw/LICENSE.AGPL-3.0.txt` (bundled in the installer), so the
model's license travels with the binary as AGPLv3 §4 requires; the model's
corresponding source is the upstream e04/deepcw-engine repository above.
